  "content": "<h2>信息：</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>这是针对现代 Minecraft 版本的 TheTitans 模组非官方重制版。</li>\n<li>修改了部分物品的合成配方，例如“诡异凋灵玩偶”和“随机物品丢弃器”，这些物品需要在末地城宝箱中找到。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>特性：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>强大的怪物，能秒杀创造模式玩家。</li>\n<li>强大的武器、工具和盔甲。</li>\n<li>更多的金制食物和钻石制食物。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>截图：</h2>\n<h3>僵尸泰坦：</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312409/description_c4e27fb1-2a9a-48e3-a1d1-0b0054b3f3bf.png\" alt=\"Zombie Titan\" width=\"850\" height=\"459\"></div>\n<h3>苦力怕泰坦：</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312409/description_de9bc1ee-7aec-4c95-aa36-5510c31295d3.png\" alt=\"Creeper Titan\" width=\"850\" height=\"450\"></div>\n<h3>僵尸猪人泰坦：</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312409/description_5ff388a8-935b-4ed7-9c65-c92d14e626bc.png\" alt=\"Zombified Piglin Titan\" width=\"850\" height=\"450\"></div>\n<h3>凋灵巨像：</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312409/description_9e6847f5-60da-4209-839e-e225722e0498.png\" alt=\"Witherzilla\" width=\"850\" height=\"460\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>作者：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/aquathree/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aqua3</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>官方下载：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-titans-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TheTitans</a>&nbsp;由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mrbt0907\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mrbt0907</a>开发</li>\n</ul>",
